  "prefLabel": "Bea 512.01 Purpose There is hereby established in the state treasury the New Hampshire HC designation and grant program fund, for the purpose of funding the grant programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 512.01 Purpose There is hereby established in the state treasury the New Hampshire HC designation and grant program fund, for the purpose of funding the grant programs established in RSA 12-O:72 and RSA 12-O:73. The fund shall be non-lapsing and shall be continually appropriated to the department.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
